OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBreezy to
OL,6,Fstart with spells of rain clearing
OL,7,Feastwards this evening, leaving
OL,8,Fshowers for a time, these easing by
OL,9,Fdawn with some clearer spells. A
OL,10,Fmilder night than the previous night
OL,11,Fwith winds becoming lighter.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FIsolated showers first thing
OL,14,FFriday morning, but dissipating under
OL,15,Fa ridge of high pressure. This leaves
OL,16,Fbrighter spells in the afternoon,
OL,17,Fespecially in the west. Temperatures
OL,18,Fwill be near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
